Quiz02_01: 50 points
(FnA1szLongestMonoSubsequence)
Please state the status of this question:
1. Incomplete
2. Solved with testing?
3. Solved without testing?
If solved, please BRIEFLY explain your strategy.

2. Solved with testing.
Uses backward DP with tailLens array to compute longest subsequence from each position,
then greedily selects leftmost valid indices. O(n^2) time complexity.

