Quiz02_02: 50 points
(sort1000WithNoRecursion)
Please state the status of this question:
1. Incomplete
2. Solved with testing?
3. Solved without testing?
If solved, please BRIEFLY explain your strategy.

2. Solved with testing.
Odd-even sorting network using compare-and-swap commands. Builds tree of swap operations
without recursion, following Quiz01_03 pattern scaled for up to 1000 elements.

